      "ordinal": 1,
      "exactText": "Default levels are `ok < watch < review < error`, with `review` as the attention threshold. Stable OK/WATCH stays quiet. Stable actionable evidence does not re-notify. Entering/changing/escalating/deescalating/leaving the actionable threshold creates an advisory transition candidate.",
